Mesa's lavapipe, which the Linux wheels hold (manimgx/lavapipe/libvulkan_lvp.so, built by
scripts/release/build_lavapipe.sh), with LLVM linked into it, and the libraries the wheels hold
for it (manimgx.libs/), with the licenses and notices they come with.

