the copyright lines of the MIT sources of the folders lavapipe is built from (src/c11,
src/compiler, src/gallium/auxiliary, drivers/llvmpipe, frontends/lavapipe, include,
targets/lavapipe and winsys/sw, src/util and src/vulkan, their tests and what lavapipe doesn't
